# Task registry written by the tools test-suite into whatever directory it
# runs in. A test artifact, never a source file — without this every
# `cargo test` leaves the tree dirty.
.sudocode-tasks.json
.sudocode/
# Agent-to-agent mailbox: per-workspace runtime state (JSONL inboxes + `.cursor-*`
# presence markers written by the local poller). Runtime, never source.
.sudocode-inbox/
